public-scalars

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Make the YAML 1.2 scalar rules the deserializer applies callable by users of the located reader: whether a scalar is null, its bool, its integer at a named width, its float, and what deserialize_any would visit. The deserializer calls the same functions, so the rules keep one home.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream serde-saphyr exposes its scalar resolution.
